---
description: JavaScript and TypeScript conventions
globs:
  - "**/*.js"
  - "**/*.mjs"
  - "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- ES modules only, named exports only, no semicolons.
- 2 spaces, 80-char lines. `const` by default, never `var`. Single quotes.
- Function declarations over arrow functions (except callbacks).
- Lint with neostandard. Vitest for tests in top-level `tests/`, named `<module>.test.js`.
- Pin dependencies to exact versions — no `^` or `~`.

Full conventions: @docs/standards/javascript.md
